The logic for `col_suffixes` (which handles DESC/ASC) seems to be in the `Columns.__str__` or `IndexColumns.__str__`.

In `IndexColumns.__str__`, if `opclasses[idx]` is empty, `col` becomes `"{column} "`. If `col_suffixes[idx]` is also present, it adds another space.

